{
  "title": "Unique Velvety Goan Sauerkraut Lassi",
  "description": "A yeasty and velvety Goan-inspired lassi featuring white sauerkraut, perfect for a weeknight dinner, this low-fat-friendly dish is a twist on traditional Indian cuisine.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
    "low-fat",
